Error [jet.SingleUseLent]: `db` still owes `consume`, so it can't be shared
  --> tests/ui/single_use_aliased.jet:14:10
    |
 14 |     peek(db)
    |          ^^
 Why: This value's type is `#SingleUse`, so it can only be moved (handed over for good); `peek` would borrow or copy it, and a `#SingleUse` value has no second use to give
 Fix: Give it away with `db.move()`, or rework `peek` so it takes ownership with a `&&` parameter
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0142
